  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Ukraine IOM 2025 Acacia support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine&#x2019;s water, sanitation, and hygiene (WASH) sector has faced deep-rooted systemic challenges, even prior to the full-scale escalation of conflict in February 2022.This assignment combines two interlinked technical mandates aimed at strengthening Ukraine&#x2019;s groundwater management capacity in both emergency response and long-term sustainability contexts. It focuses on: A.	Real-time technical supervision of deep borehole drilling operations in Kharkiv Oblast, and B.	Technical leadership in the design and establishment of a sustainable groundwater monitoring system across Kherson Oblast.</narrative>
  </description>
